{"title":"2023 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Points A,B,C and D lie along a line, in that order. If  AB:AC=1:5  BC:CD=2:1 then the ratio AB:CD equals to?\n</p><p>(A)1:1\n</p><p>(B)1:2\n</p><p>(C)1:3\n</p><p>(D)2:5\n</p><p>(E)3:5\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/2/c0269cd71d09cc127239d7eae657a37fb84fdbcb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Let } AB = x, \\ AC = y, \\ BC = z, \\ CD = w.\\]\" width=\"328\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/8/2288f78acd2e4f2f11be71a0d45e16ebc5cfd59f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Given: } AB:AC = 1:5 \\implies y = 5x\\]\" width=\"285\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/9/f793d1f020067621965447dec3db54352ac99912.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Also } BC:CD = 2:1 \\implies z = 2w\\]\" width=\"273\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/8/3d8c3d3342bd238b5020522821fef58c8106498c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Since } AC = AB + BC \\implies 5x = x + z \\implies z = 4x\\]\" width=\"412\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/e/adea97e07d8f924a7ef6e20f4978ae12c590de44.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Then } 4x = 2w \\implies w = 2x\\]\" width=\"215\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/8/248d64ac957f1fb16cd209de353154851a67c095.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Thus, } AB : CD = x : 2x = 1 : 2\\]\" width=\"246\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/3/5a3b7e7eb5753100c2a57dacf55858b9b5c7d5b3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{1:2}\\]\" width=\"45\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=~Trashboycan\" title=\"~Trashboycan\">~Trashboycan</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018023431\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.008 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 24/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1334/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36180:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018023431 and revision id 280825. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}